{"schema_version":1,"resources":{"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13114010.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13114010","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13114010","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1311401001:1":{"text":"아, 다들 돌아오셨군요! 모든 종목을 즐기셨나요?","source_cn":"呀，你们回来了！你们已经玩过所有的项目了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E611A4322BCD0FF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1311401002:1":{"text":"...음, 그런 셈이지!","source_cn":"……呃，算是吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9B0F8C7AB8A37FE3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311401003:1":{"text":"우오! 정말 빠르시네요! 전 형 누나들과 함께 눈사람을 만들고 난 뒤에 눈싸움하러 갔다 왔어요. 그런 다음 돌아와서 또 눈사람을 만들었죠! 하나... 둘... 음...","source_cn":"真快啊！我和你们堆完雪人就去打雪仗，然后又回来堆雪人！...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF6BF04E4E47F7A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311401004:1":{"text":"어라? 나중에 만든 눈사람은 다 어디 간 거지...? 내가 까먹었나...?","source_cn":"诶？我后来堆了几个雪人呢？怎么忘了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x34297586D518541F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311401005:1":{"text":"꼬마야, 너무 많이 놀아서 지쳤나 보다~ 일단은 얼른 집으로 돌아가렴.","source_cn":"小朋友，你一定玩得很累了，还是先回家吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF1E7DBC3ED9F5F9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311401006:1":{"text":"네, 돌아가서 엄마가 만든 버섯 수프를 먹어야겠어요!","source_cn":"嗯，我要回去喝一大碗妈妈炖的蘑菇汤！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x694A18B892AB1C31","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:亚历克斯":{"text":"알렉스","source":"亚历克斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":7,"localized_text_count":6,"speaker_count":3}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13114020.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13114020","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13114020","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1311402001:0":{"text":"저기... 우리가 탐험을 하러 가기로 했던 것 같은데?","source_cn":"那个……我记得我们说好要去探险？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51817945A8CFC88F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1311402002:0":{"text":"맞아... 하지만 우린 탐험에 필요한 음식과 도구를 준비하지 못했어...","source_cn":"的确……不过我们还没有准备探险时的食物和工具……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE588710349838AA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311402003:1":{"text":"제전이 끝난 뒤에 다시... 어라, 제전이 끝난 건가?","source_cn":"等祭典结束以后再……咦，祭典结束了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D717146BBD4C3D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311402004:1":{"text":"...이제 시작했던 거 아니었나?","source_cn":"……不应该是刚开始没多久吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7AA857E4CBFB8A02","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311402005:0":{"text":"다들 무사하군요, 다행이에요!","source_cn":"你们也没事了，太好了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6F3E429C348FAF7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311402006:1":{"text":"네? 뭐라고요? 음, 우리 같이 눈싸움하러 가기로 했던 거 아닌가요?","source_cn":"啊？你在说什么？呃，我记得咱们不是一起打过雪仗来着？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F8946719CB5113D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311402007:0":{"text":"맞아요! 진짜 돌아왔네요! 헤헤!","source_cn":"不错，看来你们是真的恢复了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB84AEAFA62DE69E3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:帕特里克":{"text":"패트릭","source":"帕特里克","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:克什托夫":{"text":"크리스토프","source":"克什托夫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:帕芙拉":{"text":"파블라","source":"帕芙拉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:薇丝莎娃":{"text":"베르샤바","source":"薇丝莎娃","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":8,"localized_text_count":7,"speaker_count":6}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13114030.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13114030","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13114030","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1311403001:0":{"text":"난 대체 얼음 위에 아름답고 로맨틱한 하트를 만든 거야, 안 만든 거야...?","source_cn":"我到底有没有在冰上滑出一个漂亮的、浪漫的心型啊……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB36FECDD7786497C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1311403002:0":{"text":"이상하네, 왠지 이곳에서 아주 오랫동안 서 있었던 것 같은데... 휴, 발이 다 저리네. 너무 긴장한 탓인가?","source_cn":"好奇怪，总觉得我在这里站了好久。呼，脚都站麻了。我是太...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEAB156FF3E48CBD6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311403003:0":{"text":"긴장할 것 없어요. 하트를 그리는 건 그만두고 그냥 바로 프러포즈하시는 건 어때요?!","source_cn":"不要紧张，别滑什么心型了，直接去求婚吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0C2990E5044F78DB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1311403004:0":{"text":"쉿! 조용히 해요! 카야가 듣겠어요... 나의 카야, 에스페리아에서 가장 아름다운 여인...","source_cn":"嘘，小声点！别让卡娅听见……我的卡娅，全伊索米亚最美的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAD0D82DDB16A7A45","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311403005:0":{"text":"어라, 이 말을 했던 것 같은 느낌이 드는데...","source_cn":"呃，我总觉得我好像跟你说过这句话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF437664A62FAEAA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:莱赫":{"text":"레프","source":"莱赫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13114040.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13114040","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13114040","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:0:1311404001:0":{"text":"다들 멍하긴 하지만, 타임 루프에서 벗어난 것 같아!","source_cn":"虽然大家都很迷茫，但好像都从循环中解放了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF92168CAA6783B1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:1:1311404002:0":{"text":"다행이야. 이제 얼음조각 쪽으로 가서 상황을 살펴보자!","source_cn":"太好了，我们再去去冰雕那里看看情况！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD640FF702ADFE53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:漫漫":{"text":"해미","source":"漫漫","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":3,"localized_text_count":2,"speaker_count":2}},"locales/kr/ep3/quest_story/13114050.json":{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13114050","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13114050","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1311405001:0":{"text":"발리카, 여기 계셨군요! 당신의 그 전우들... 어떻게 되었나요?","source_cn":"瓦丽卡，你也来这里了！你的那些战友们，他们……怎么样了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF08706C440F4E3EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1311405002:0":{"text":"신경 써줘서 고마워. 역사의 변화를 느낀 사람들도 있지만 대부분은... 여전히 멍한 것 같아.","source_cn":"谢谢你的关心，有少数人似乎也感觉到了历史的改变，但大部...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6C8A62C4F412F61B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1311405003:0":{"text":"어쩌면 이건 그들의 숙명일지도 모르지. 하지만 그렇게 강한 적을 물리쳤으니... 다들 기뻐할 거라고 생각해.","source_cn":"或许这就是他们的宿命吧。但我想他们都会很高兴……曾经战...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21B666F415EA1201","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:4:1311405003":{"text":"어쩌면 이건 그들의 숙명일지도 모르지. 하지만 그렇게 강한 적을 물리쳤으니... 다들 기뻐할 거라고 생각해.","source_cn":"或许这就是他们的宿命吧。但我想他们都会很高兴……曾经战胜过那么强大的敌人。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x21B666F415EA1201","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1311405004:0":{"text":"우스울지도 모르지만 난 그저 과거의 내가 보고 싶었을 뿐이야.","source_cn":"说出来也许很可笑，我只是想来看看过去的自己。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCF5DB313A4013A41","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1311405006:0":{"text":"오랜 시간 동안 난 단 한 번도 이곳에 온 적이 없었거든. 조각상의 얼굴도, 사람들의 경의도 마주할 자신이 없다는 걸 알고 있었으니까...","source_cn":"这么多年以来，我从没来过这里。我知道自己不敢正视雕像的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB0739C0A6B75CF75","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1311405007:0":{"text":"영웅이라... 이 얼마나 무거운 칭호야... 과거의 난 이 칭호를 짊어지지 못한 채 천 년이라는 시간을 보냈어...","source_cn":"英雄……多么沉重的称呼啊。过去的我自认无法扛起这个称谓...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4940FC387920934","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1311405008:0":{"text":"하지만 너희 덕분에 모든 것이 달라졌어.","source_cn":"不过，多亏你们，这一切都不一样了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA41CDC28734A75BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:9:1311405008":{"text":"하지만 너희 덕분에 모든 것이 달라졌어.","source_cn":"不过，多亏你们，这一切都不一样了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA41CDC28734A75BE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1311405009:0":{"text":"내 자신... 하, 고마워.","source_cn":"我自己吗……哈，谢谢你。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x71BDB671CC2F2D2F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1311405011:0":{"text":"이제야 이 이름과 경의를 감당할 수 있을 것 같아. 미래에 내가 이 모든 것을 저버리지 않기를.","source_cn":"我想，我终于可以承担起这个名字和这份敬意了。但愿未来，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE62D8724D655D941","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:0:1":{"text":"이건 너 자신의 선택이야","source_cn":"这是你自己的选择","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x429DDD932EBDADAC","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이건 너 자신의 선택이야","female":"이건 너 자신의 선택이야","variant_male_record_index":"67836","variant_female_record_index":"67837","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1311405010:0":{"text":"나도. ","source_cn":"我也是。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x95943130E1C84AB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:9:1:2":{"text":"너와 함께 싸울 수 있어서 영광이었어","source_cn":"我很荣幸和你一起战斗","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x1207F11E72BEA503","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"너와 함께 싸울 수 있어서 영광이었어","female":"너와 함께 싸울 수 있어서 영광이었어","variant_male_record_index":"67838","variant_female_record_index":"67839","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:0:1":{"text":"네가 여기 온 건...","source_cn":"你来这里是……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x3BE26FA9ABBB0ACD","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"네가 여기 온 건...","female":"네가 여기 온 건...","variant_male_record_index":"67832","variant_female_record_index":"67833","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1311405005:0":{"text":"추억한다기보단, 그냥... 보고 싶었어.","source_cn":"谈不上回忆，只是……想来看看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAB9AC8C38BC581E1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:4:1:2":{"text":"과거를 추억하러 온 거야?","source_cn":"你是来回忆过去吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x7C538F5AE22CEC81","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"과거를 추억하러 온 거야?","female":"과거를 추억하러 온 거야?","variant_male_record_index":"67834","variant_female_record_index":"67835","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:满满":{"text":"치피","source":"满满","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:瓦丽卡":{"text":"발리카","source":"瓦丽卡","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":18,"localized_text_count":17,"speaker_count":2}}}}